@startuml M6-Module-Dependencies

' Simplified module dependencies showing the main data flow
' Top layer: User interacts with CLI
' Middle layers: 3 main pipelines (Crawl -> Index -> Search)
' Control layer: Coordinates all operations
' Storage: M4 distributed key-value store with M1-M5 support

!define BGCOLOR #F5F5F5
!define ACCENTCOLOR #1F77B4

skinparam backgroundColor BGCOLOR
skinparam packageFontColor #333
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #E8F4F8
skinparam componentBorderColor ACCENTCOLOR
skinparam arrowColor #333

title M6 Search Engine - Module Dependencies (Simplified)

actor User

package "CLI" {
  component [search-cli]
}

package "Control" {
  component [bootstrap\n& pipelines]
}

package "CRAWL Phase" {
  component [fetch from\nGitHub API]
  component [create\ndocuments]
}

package "INDEX Phase" {
  component [text\nprocessing\n(extract, normalize,\ntokenize, stem, ngrams)]
  component [build\ninverted index]
  component [calculate\nTF/DF stats]
}

package "SEARCH Phase" {
  component [parse &\nprocess query]
  component [TF-IDF\nranking]
  component [metadata\nboosts]
  component [score &\nformat results]
}

package "Storage (M4-KV)" {
  component [index data]
  component [TF stats]
  component [DF stats]
  component [document\nmetadata]
}

package "Distributed Runtime" {
  component [M1: Serialization]
  component [M2: Communication]
  component [M3: Gossip\n(node sync)]
  component [M5: MapReduce\n(optional)]
}

'' Main Flow
User --> [search-cli]
[search-cli] --> [bootstrap\n& pipelines]

[bootstrap\n& pipelines] --> [fetch from\nGitHub API]
[fetch from\nGitHub API] --> [create\ndocuments]
[create\ndocuments] --> [text\nprocessing\n(extract, normalize,\ntokenize, stem, ngrams)]

[text\nprocessing\n(extract, normalize,\ntokenize, stem, ngrams)] --> [build\ninverted index]
[build\ninverted index] --> [calculate\nTF/DF stats]

[calculate\nTF/DF stats] --> [parse &\nprocess query]
[parse &\nprocess query] --> [TF-IDF\nranking]
[TF-IDF\nranking] --> [metadata\nboosts]
[metadata\nboosts] --> [score &\nformat results]

[score &\nformat results] --> [search-cli]
[search-cli] --> User

'' Storage connections
[create\ndocuments] --> [index data]: store
[build\ninverted index] --> [index data]: store
[calculate\nTF/DF stats] --> [TF stats]: store
[calculate\nTF/DF stats] --> [DF stats]: store
[fetch from\nGitHub API] --> [document\nmetadata]: store

[TF-IDF\nranking] -.-> [TF stats]: lookup
[TF-IDF\nranking] -.-> [DF stats]: lookup
[metadata\nboosts] -.-> [document\nmetadata]: lookup

'' Runtime support
[index data] --> [M1: Serialization]
[TF stats] --> [M1: Serialization]
[DF stats] --> [M1: Serialization]

[M1: Serialization] --> [M2: Communication]
[M2: Communication] --> [M3: Gossip\n(node sync)]

[M5: MapReduce\n(optional)] -.-> [fetch from\nGitHub API]: parallel
[M5: MapReduce\n(optional)] -.-> [text\nprocessing\n(extract, normalize,\ntokenize, stem, ngrams)]: parallel

note bottom of [bootstrap\n& pipelines]
  Orchestrates 3 phases
end note

note bottom of [text\nprocessing\n(extract, normalize,\ntokenize, stem, ngrams)]
  Standardizes all text:
  extract -> normalize ->
  tokenize -> stem -> ngrams
end note

note bottom of [TF-IDF\nranking]
  Core ranking algorithm
  combines frequency &
  inverse document freq
end note

note bottom of [M3: Gossip\n(node sync)]
  Keeps all nodes in sync
  for distributed search
end note

@enduml
